      q: 'Are bubble machines and bubble guns consumable?',
      a: 'The toy is durable; the bubble liquid is not. That is the commercial reason this category repeats: a retailer who sells the machine needs refill solution, and a distributor who supplies the machine can supply the refill. We ship the machine with a starter bottle, and the solution itself can be quoted separately in larger pack sizes — ask for it when you request pricing.',
