      q: 'When should a party distributor place the order?',
      a: 'Count backwards from the shelf date, not forwards from today. Production is typically 15 to 25 days, sea freight 20 to 35 days, plus customs clearance and inland delivery. For a spring and summer season that means committing in the autumn and shipping before Chinese New Year, because the factory calendar closes for one to three weeks around it and every supplier in Chenghai is competing for the same container slots in the same fortnight.',
    },
